### Progress Tracking
Implementation requirements:

1. Damage Tracking
   ```typescript
   const trackNodeDamage = (node: Node, side: Side, damage: number) => {
     const current = node.damageByTeam.get(side) || 0;
     node.damageByTeam.set(side, current + damage);
     evaluateControl(node);
   };
   ```
   - Track damage per side
   - Update running totals
   - Trigger evaluations

2. Control Evaluation
   ```typescript
   const evaluateControl = (node: Node) => {
     const controlStatus = calculateControlStatus(node);
     if (controlStatus !== node.currentControl) {
       updateNodeControl(node, controlStatus);
     }
   };
   ```
   - Compare against threshold
   - Check opposing control
   - Trigger state changes

3. Network Effects
   ```typescript
   const updateNetworkEffects = (node: Node) => {
     const connectedNodes = getConnectedNodes(node);
     connectedNodes.forEach(connected => {
       recalculateNodeEffects(connected);
     });
   };
   ```
   - Update connected nodes
   - Recalculate network bonuses
   - Propagate effects

